            "notes": "# Bango!\n\nYou want your first power to be  [Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235) \n\nIt will help you finish more kills in the first 2 rounds, increasing your cash generation which is important in the early rounds.\n\nFor items, I recommend  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) from the Weapon tree and the  [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) assuming you will get many kills.  You can also use some armor, weapon damage or even the  [Adrenaline Shot](item_ab8eba6a-0bda-4b12-8854-4ba4169b515f) that grants 50 overhealth from health packs depending on enemy team composition or the map you are playing.\n\nIn this round, you mostly ignore the enemy tank, you want to get picks on the support and dps whom are still very squishy in the early rounds.",
