            "notes": "# Zip Grease\n\n [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6) is your bread and butter in this build.\n\nAfter detonating your concussion mine, your next 2 frag grenades launched will move at 200% its normal speed, making it easy to hit flying heroes and making your enemies wonder how you hit them so easily.\n\nYou could launch yourself and hit another airborne hero or you can throw the mine at them to launch them and hit them while in the air. You also get a bonus for hitting airborne players.\n\nGeometry skills are also very important, your projectile does not lose speed when it rebounds.\n\nIf you can afford it, [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is a great item to buy too.",
