            "notes": "# Hop Boom & Spiked Gloves\n\nDo you like to melee airborne targets?  I do\n\nIf you do too, get  [Spiked Gloves](item_70573d1b-b952-4418-a13f-5728ff472a07)\n\nAlso  [Hop Boom](item_7f85e3a0-02ad-4de5-af4c-1d89f779dc8a) synergizes well with  [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6); make sure you have at least 4+ ammo before jumping your concussion mine. Before landing, shot twice, and after landing your  [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6) will be active again from  [Hop Boom](item_7f85e3a0-02ad-4de5-af4c-1d89f779dc8a) and you can shot twice again at 200% projectile speed. You can also delay the Hop Boom effect by holding spacebar.\n\nFor other items, I prioritize Attack Speed, but you can choose whatever you prefer.\n\nLifestealing is up to you, it'll depend on your healers and your own playstyle.",
