            "notes": "# Soot Shaker & Mark of the Kitsune\n\nMany Stadium games end on round 5, but you could also go for  [Slapnel](item_960e424b-3533-46b1-8063-11b575225647) now and  [Soot Shaker](item_365d55fe-06c9-4600-8369-5f00bd0c5b19) on round 7.\n\nYou are basically a Junkrat Sniper at this point with [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb)\n\nBe careful when you gain air, some heroes can eliminate you before you land at this point in the game, but with the element of surprise, they don't stand a chance.",
